<title>USA: MotivePower seeks NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>MotivePower seeks NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MotivePower Industries Inc said on Tuesday that it will apply for a New York Stock Exchange listing.</p>
<p>The company expects to begin trading on the exchange in the third quarter under the symbol &quot;MPO,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Since going public in April 1994, the company's stock has been traded on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company will begin the formal application process immediately, said MotivePower, a maker of engineered locomotive components.</p>
</text>
